# Junbi Frontend Rules

## Stack

React Native + Expo 54 (managed workflow), Expo Router v6, NativeWind, Zustand, TanStack React Query, Firebase Auth, TypeScript strict.

## Styling

- NativeWind `className` for all static styles. `style={{}}` only for computed/animated values.
- All colors from `lib/tokens.ts` TOKENS.colors. Zero hardcoded hex.
- No inline static styles — ever.

## Lists

- FlashList always (never FlatList). Set `estimatedItemSize` on every FlashList.
- Skeleton loader required on every screen that loads async data.

## Modals

- `@gorhom/bottom-sheet` for every modal/sheet. No React Native `Modal`.
- Use `BottomSheetWrapper` from `components/ui/` for consistent behavior.

## Animations

- Reanimated 4: `useAnimatedStyle`, `withSpring`, `withTiming`.
- Exception: `Animated.ScrollView` (legacy API) for parallax scroll only.

## Icons

- Lucide React Native only. No other icon libraries.

## State

- Zustand stores (`stores/`) for all app state.
- Components call store actions — never `lib/api/*` directly from components.
- TanStack Query for data that needs cache/refetch behavior.

## Forms

- React Hook Form + Zod. `useForm<T>({ resolver: zodResolver(schema) })`.
- Never validate manually with if/else.

## Navigation

- Expo Router only. Never import from `react-navigation`.

## Accessibility

- `accessibilityLabel` on every touchable element.

## Haptics

- `Haptics.impactAsync(Medium)` on every primary button press.

## PROHIBITIONS

- No FlatList
- No hardcoded hex colors
- No `any` TypeScript
- No `Modal` from React Native core
- No react-navigation imports
- No icon libraries other than Lucide
- No inline static styles
- No user-facing strings hardcoded in components (use `lib/copy.ts`)
- Do not edit `lib/tokens.ts`, `babel.config.js`, `metro.config.js`, `tailwind.config.js`, `app.json`
